            "body": "## Context\n\n`scripts/update_slack_apps.py` has pure functions (`merge_apps`, `parse_app_cards`, `_find_apps_in_json`, `_parse_next_data`) with no tests; CI only runs `py_compile` on it. `merge_apps` must keep curated security fields.\n\n## What to do\n\n1. Add `tests/test_update_slack_apps.py` with fixture HTML/JSON.\n2. Extend the blt-panini row in `scripts/ci/tests.tsv` with `pip install -r scripts/requirements.txt \u0026\u0026 python -m unittest discover -s tests`.\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n\n- [ ] Merge keeps curated fields and adds new apps with defaults\n- [ ] Parser handles card HTML and a `__NEXT_DATA__` blob\n- [ ] CI runs the tests\n\n## How to test locally\n\n```bash\nscripts/ci/test.sh blt-panini\n```\n\n---\nSize: **M**. Comment `/assign` to claim this issue; claims with no activity are released after 7 days. Clone from https://git.owaspblt.org/BLT.git and open your pull request there.\n",
